<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Usage">Usage</span></h3>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><span style="color: #0000FF;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Case%20keyword" title="Case keyword (page does not exist)">case</a></span> EVENT_TYPE_AMBIENT_CONTINUE:<br />{<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oInstigator = <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GetEventObject" title="GetEventObject">GetEventObject</a>(ev, <span style="color: #7F007F;">0</span>); <span style="color: #007F00; font-style: italic;">// Instigator</span><br /><br />    <span style="color:#007F00; font-style:italic;">// insert event-handling code here</span><br /><br />    <span style="color:#0000FF;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Break%20keyword" title="Break keyword (page does not exist)">break</a></span>;<br />}</div>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>If the event was fired because the party is near a creature, the 'instigator' is the nearest party member. If the event was fired at the end of a conversation, the instigator is the creature conversing.
</p>
